23. For the aforesaid reasons, this Court deems it appropriate to enlarge the petitioner on bail in connection with his custody arising out of FIR no. 91/2019 registered at Police Station Kalindi Kunj under Sections 365/302/201/120B/34 of the IPC, subject to the following terms and conditions:
a. The petitioner shall not leave India without prior permission of the court concerned;
b. He shall appear before the Trial Court as and when directed; c. He shall provide his mobile number(s) to the Investigating Officer and keep the same active at all times;
d. He shall not commit any offence during the period of bail; and This is a digitally signed order.

